# MIDI (LLP 1125 D6–D8): ports the drive prefers and a request the agent
# answers; sendMIDI's at=, a late one and a malformed one; notes on two
# outputs (one not connected), clock out, a tempo edit, an offset edit, a key
# restart, the gate's stop, a finite take's ended=; messages coalesced and
# heard by two elements; an output pulled.
prefer midi.outputs synth midi.inputs keys,pads
tap ask
tap send
tap late
tap malformed
clock +100
midi keys b0 07 10 b0 07 20 90 3c 40 b0 07 30
midi pads 90 30 01
tap start
clock +700
tap faster
clock +600
midi keys 90 3e 50
tap later
clock +900
tap restart
clock +800
tap ownstart
tap stop
clock +400
tap finite
clock +4000
prefer midi.outputs drums
clock +100
